  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Options &amp; accessories </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1994",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Machine table standing workstation",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Stable and secure positioning of the »pomBasic« inspection machine as a standing workstation. Includes pull-out board for mouse and keyboard.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/e/csm_option_tisch_59_536b12161b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1993",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Machine table seated workstation",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Stable and secure positioning of the »pomBasic« inspection machine as a seated workstation for optimum comfort, even on time-consuming inspection tasks. Includes pull-out board for mouse and keyboard.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_option_sitzplatz_b2fbd33b41.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1991",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Additional illumination (white/red)",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Enables transmitted light measurement of the peripheral area using flat LED lighting. The illumination is positioned directly opposite the video microscope system. This means that outer contours, step lengths, point angles and much more can be measured.<br/><br/>Additional illumination white for »pomBasic« with »pomColorCam« optics, <br/>Additional illumination red for »pomBasic MTI«</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/5/csm_option_diffusor_1a0262860e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1989",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»pomLightTube«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Additional illumination adjustable in height for optimum, high-contrast lighting of even the smallest areas along the tool cutting edge – for radial and axial incident light measurements. </p> <p>»pomLightTube« white/red for »pomBasic« <br/>»pomMicroLightTube« blue for »pomBasic MTI«</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/e/csm_option_pomlighttube_5dc57c1907.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1987",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Single LED spot illumination (white/red)",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The dimmable LED spot illumination can be flexibly positioned in relation to the tool to provide optimum lighting even for undercut tool geometries.<br/><br/>LED spot white for »pomBasic« with »pomColorCam« optics, <br/>LED spot red for »pomBasic« with »pomCam« optics and »pomBasic MTI«</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/a/csm_option_led-spotbeleuchtung_2176f457a4.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1985",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Drawing holder",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Ideal for attaching drawings in the immediate vicinity of measurements. The magnetic ball joint allows flexible and optimum alignment for the operator. The drawings can be easily fixed and quickly changed using magnets.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/6/csm_option_zeichnungshalterung_dce3bb4436.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 682
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1983",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tool/accessory tray",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The tray attached to the left-hand side of the inspection device allows tools with a maximum shank size of D 50 mm to be stored carefully. The tray also offers sufficient space for small parts and indexable inserts.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/c/csm_option_werkzeugablage_a942acc1be.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 646
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1981",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Extended swivel table",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For very long tools such as drills or reamers, the extended swivel table enables perfect tool fixing.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_option_schwenktisch_5be30c1285.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1979",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Extended holder for deep hole drill",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Support for extra-long tools D 3 mm to D 20 mm up to a length of 1000 mm. The support height of the prism can be adjusted. The connection to the extended swivel table is mechanical.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/9/csm_option_aufnahme_tischlochbohrer_28f38c0faf.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1996",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Optics package",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Depending on the application, three optics options are available: the »pomColorCam« color camera with optical zoom, the »pomCam« monochrome camera with a fixed aperture and digital zoom, and the »pomMicroCam« monochrome camera with optical zoom, designed specifically for micro tools.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/4/csm_option_optikpaket_25b546fc15.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 789
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1998",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "CNC Control of the camera axis",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Enables the capture of fully in-focus images of the tool for comprehensive inspection, automatic positioning of the camera relative to the tool surface, and CNC-controlled movement of the camera axis via the joystick control in the software. Manual infinite fine adjustment is also available.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/9/csm_option_cnc-steuerung_c7a908346f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 789
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2000",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Color laser printer",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For log printouts directly on the inspection device.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/2/csm_option_farblaserdrucker_8ced4bdfd3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2002",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "UPS system",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The UPS system for uninterruptible power supply ensures that your computer is shut down properly in the event of a power grid fault to prevent data loss. Mains voltages of 230 V~ (Europe) and 120 V~ (USA) are available.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/a/csm_option_USV-Anlage_423fc9705e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2004",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1977",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
